  "description": "The Avomi Cliq Pod Kit combines the convenience of disposables with the practicality of a reusable vape , thanks to its rechargeable battery and replaceable prefilled pods. Designed for effortless MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping, the Cliq delivers up to 6000 puffs through its advanced auto-refill system, ensuring a consistently smooth and flavourful experience. The LED digital display keeps track of battery life, while the metallic soft-touch finish enhances comfort and durability. With premium mesh coil technology, the Cliq maximises vapour production and flavour consistency. The auto-draw mechanism provides an intuitive inhale, while the 2ml pod and 10ml refill container ensure an uninterrupted e-liquid flow. Each pod comes prefilled with Avomi’s premium Nicotine Salt e-liquid at 20mg strength, delivering a balanced throat hit. Explore the full flavour range of 10 Avomi Cliq Starter Kits or refresh your setup with Avomi Cliq Prefilled Replacement Pod + Refill packs. Avomi Cliq Prefilled Kit Flavours • Blueberry Ice • Cola Ice • Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Pink Lemonade • Fizzy Cherry • Raspberry Blackcurrant • Lemon & Lime • Spearmint • Pineapple Ice • Strawberry Ice • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice • Watermelon Ice Please Note: USB Cable Sold Separately Avomi Cliq Pod Vape Kit Shop Avomi Cliq Refill Pods",
